<title>JAPAN: Horipro to repurchase shares for stock options.</title>
<headline>Horipro to repurchase shares for stock options.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Entertainment production company Horipro Inc said on Wednesday that it would spend two billion yen to buy back 1.33 million of its shares, with the aim of introducing a stock option scheme.</p>
</text>
